    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch12-49: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.29";
    dc:description "A restricted statistical association between known design and approximate minimality could be tested after compiling a corpus. No existing public resource directly supplies certified minimal rules and provenance across the intended scope, and minimality cannot uniquely identify purpose.";
